<task id="021" project="code-quality-and-assurance-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>BFF Tranche A: fix the broken invoice-totals ServiceClient casts in-place (Bug-1) + focused test</title>
    <phase>2 BFF Remediation</phase>
    <tranche>A</tranche>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Fixes a latent production correctness bug with a focused test (touches tests/) — FULL; TEST-MODIFYING override also applies.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Brownfield root-cause on a live invoice path (3 always-failing casts); correctness-critical — Opus.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>BFF hot-path contention; Finance files are among the most-contested; /conflict-check before the PR; small sequential PRs.</parallel-reason>
